<p><strong>Warning from experience:</strong> We see a lot of DIY seam repair attempts around Hartselle. Silicon caulk from the hardware store isn't a gutter sealer — it breaks down within a year in Alabama's humidity. If you're going to patch seams, use actual gutter sealant. Better yet, replace the system if seams are failing in multiple spots.</p>

